WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 10=

22
01:56.657 --> 01:57.336
- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.

23
02:00.297 --> 02:00.777
Meng,

24
02:01.176 --> 02:02.417
I'm at the restaurant entrance.

25
02:03.017 --> 02:04.096
I'm coming right now.

26
02:18.776 --> 02:19.216
Wait.

27
02:24.896 --> 02:25.577
Long time no see.

28
02:26.496 --> 02:28.611
Didn't think I'd see you again.

29
02:31.216 --> 02:31.977
Zi,

30
02:32.896 --> 02:33.496
I'm so dizzy.

31
02:33.736 --> 02:34.776
Slow down.

32
02:36.857 --> 02:37.936
I feel so dizzy.

33
02:38.216 --> 02:39.776
I'll get you some honey water.

34
02:40.537 --> 02:41.697
Don't bother, Zi.

35
02:41.736 --> 02:43.056
Drink more, and I'll throw up.

36
02:44.776 --> 02:46.137
Then I'll call Di Liren,

37
02:46.297 --> 02:47.616
telling him you're sleeping over.

38
02:49.537 --> 02:51.336
I already told him.

39
02:51.776 --> 02:53.336
I told him that Chestnut

40
02:53.417 --> 02:54.417
wouldn't let me go

41
02:54.417 --> 02:55.656
and insisted I stay over.

42
03:56.977 --> 03:57.948
Long time no see.

43
03:58.697 --> 03:59.736
Didn't think I'd see you

44
03:59.736 --> 04:00.137
again.

45
04:00.297 --> 04:02.137
I'm sorry. Who are you?

46
04:03.176 --> 04:03.977
You don't know me?

47
04:06.377 --> 04:07.896
Take a closer look.

48
04:08.336 --> 04:10.017
I haven't gained weight or gone bald.

49
04:10.577 --> 04:11.577
I haven't changed a bit.

50
04:13.776 --> 04:15.097
Did we

51
04:16.456 --> 04:18.057
meet at a dinner party before?

52
04:18.216 --> 04:18.776
Last week?

53
04:20.536 --> 04:21.017
No.

54
04:24.896 --> 04:25.497
I'm Kang Long.

55
04:25.937 --> 04:27.536
K-A-N-G, Kang. L-O-N-G, Long.

56
04:29.017 --> 04:30.456
Oh, you're Dr. Kang!

57
04:30.656 --> 04:31.656
Heard much about you.

58
04:32.257 --> 04:32.896
I'm so sorry.

59
04:32.896 --> 04:34.137
I have a terrible memory,

60
04:34.216 --> 04:35.296
and I'm bad with faces.

61
04:35.717 --> 04:36.617
Gotta pick up a friend.

62
04:36.617 --> 04:37.656
Let's talk another time.

63
04:37.937 --> 04:38.377
Goodbye.

64
04:40.497 --> 04:41.096
See you!

65
04:51.336 --> 04:52.336
Mom,

66
04:53.216 --> 04:56.257
why are you suddenly

67
04:56.257 --> 04:58.296
playing music without words again?

68
05:03.137 --> 05:03.737
Because I

69
05:03.737 --> 05:05.296
need to think some things through.

70
05:05.536 --> 05:06.577
Quiet music

71
05:06.737 --> 05:08.257
helps me think better.

72
05:21.137 --> 05:22.257
Thank you tonight, Mr. Tian.

73
05:22.896 --> 05:24.057
If not for your help,

74
05:24.377 --> 05:25.216
we'd have delayed

75
05:25.257 --> 05:26.216
the next batch.

76
05:32.697 --> 05:33.336
Since your wife

77
05:33.336 --> 05:34.416
isn't coming back tonight,

78
05:35.617 --> 05:36.776
just eat this bowl of soup.

79
05:37.497 --> 05:38.577
No need. You have it.

80
05:38.737 --> 05:39.497
I already did.

81
05:39.776 --> 05:41.135
Plenty left in the pot.

82
05:41.257 --> 05:41.776
Throw it out.

83
05:42.096 --> 05:42.937
It'd be such a waste.

84
05:43.057 --> 05:43.697
Just eat it up.

85
05:44.896 --> 05:46.456
I haven't eaten leftovers for long.

86
05:50.896 --> 05:51.737
I guess you forgot

87
05:52.057 --> 05:53.257
what leftovers taste like.

88
05:54.057 --> 05:54.737
I didn't.

89
05:56.577 --> 05:57.697
That's not what I meant.

90
05:58.456 --> 05:59.336
You've worked hard.

91
05:59.336 --> 06:00.017
You're exhausted.

92
06:00.257 --> 06:00.937
Don't mind me.

93
06:01.377 --> 06:02.500
She's not coming back.

94
06:02.617 --> 06:03.430
Don't bother

95
06:03.430 --> 06:04.381
with breakfast tomorrow.

96
06:06.296 --> 06:07.017
What's this about?

97
06:07.137 --> 06:07.737
Right.

98
06:08.017 --> 06:09.296
Fresh food is always better.

99
06:11.177 --> 06:12.017
Just a comment.

100
06:12.096 --> 06:12.937
Why get so angry?

101
06:13.017 --> 06:13.856
I think you're right.

102
06:13.856 --> 06:14.887
That's how leftovers are.

103
06:14.887 --> 06:15.737
Nobody wants them.

104
06:15.737 --> 06:16.497
Once tasted,

105
06:16.617 --> 06:17.416
then tossed.

106
06:18.017 --> 06:18.776
I'll dump it now.

107
06:21.336 --> 06:22.296
Dump it!

108
06:22.456 --> 06:23.656
Who wants this junk?

109
06:24.336 --> 06:25.456
Treated like garbage!

110
06:28.377 --> 06:29.377
Leftovers!

111
06:29.817 --> 06:31.017
Who wants to eat leftovers?

112
06:31.697 --> 06:32.177
Dump it all!

113
06:32.456 --> 06:33.456
Who doesn't crave good,

114
06:33.976 --> 06:34.817
fresh food?

115
06:36.377 --> 06:37.497
Calm down!

116
06:37.856 --> 06:38.536
I've been like

117
06:38.577 --> 06:39.336
an extinct volcano.

118
06:39.536 --> 06:40.497
Been calm long enough!

119
06:40.656 --> 06:41.577
Stay calm any longer,

120
06:41.856 --> 06:43.216
and I'll end up as the leftovers,

121
06:44.896 --> 06:45.937
dumped in the trash,

122
06:46.216 --> 06:46.896
down the drain,

123
06:47.057 --> 06:48.057
rotting away!

124
06:48.577 --> 06:49.497
How could that happen?

125
06:50.177 --> 06:50.856
Why wouldn't it?

126
06:51.017 --> 06:51.896
Isn't it human nature?

127
06:52.177 --> 06:53.257
Always craving what's new.

128
06:53.536 --> 06:54.336
Fresh food,

129
06:54.617 --> 06:55.257
fresh games,

130
06:55.377 --> 06:55.976
a fresh lover!

131
06:56.177 --> 06:57.177
Used up,

132
06:57.497 --> 06:58.856
then tossed aside for the next.

133
06:59.017 --> 06:59.776
Do I bother you

134
06:59.856 --> 07:00.456
by being here?

135
07:01.177 --> 07:02.017
Have you been dying

136
07:02.017 --> 07:03.057
to get rid of me for long?

137
07:04.096 --> 07:05.057
So you can stay here

138
07:05.336 --> 07:06.336
and be with her,

139
07:06.617 --> 07:08.057
with kids and a perfect family?

140
07:08.257 --> 07:09.617
What am I to you?

141
07:10.057 --> 07:11.296
What are we?

142
07:14.856 --> 07:15.937
Let go of me!

143
07:55.216 --> 07:56.336
Does it taste good?

144
08:01.817 --> 08:02.817
It couldn't be better.

145
08:03.257 --> 08:03.976
All these years,

146
08:04.377 --> 08:05.216
you've remembered

147
08:05.536 --> 08:06.257
what I like to eat

148
08:07.017 --> 08:08.137
and all my habits clearly.

149
08:11.497 --> 08:12.336
I've always held

150
08:13.296 --> 08:14.296
your love right here.

151
08:16.216 --> 08:17.137
Why bring this up

152
08:17.456 --> 08:18.536
all of a sudden?

153
08:49.536 --> 08:50.337
Has it been a while

154
08:50.737 --> 08:52.176
since you visited Yu Meng's dad?

155
08:52.497 --> 08:53.097
How about

156
08:53.696 --> 08:54.576
I make some soup

157
08:54.977 --> 08:56.439
and drop it off in your name?

158
08:57.377 --> 08:58.176
I was actually

159
08:58.296 --> 08:59.296
planning to take Yu Meng

160
08:59.416 --> 09:00.257
to visit him lately,

161
09:00.857 --> 09:02.257
and get a pregnancy test done.

162
09:03.056 --> 09:04.217
But she says she's busy.

163
09:04.857 --> 09:05.536
I'll find a way

164
09:05.576 --> 09:06.432
to take her today.

165
09:06.896 --> 09:07.296
No need.

166
09:08.617 --> 09:09.377
I have a plan.

167
09:12.137 --> 09:12.776
Wait for me.

168
09:21.137 --> 09:21.696
Help me

169
09:21.737 --> 09:22.617
drop this off.

170
09:23.097 --> 09:23.737
What's this?

171
09:24.257 --> 09:25.296
It's a recording device.

172
09:26.428 --> 09:27.936
Mr. Tian and some minority shareholders

173
09:27.936 --> 09:29.257
go to the hospital constantly.

174
09:29.457 --> 09:30.097
I suspect

175
09:30.097 --> 09:30.816
they're discussing

176
09:30.936 --> 09:31.776
the equity shift

177
09:31.816 --> 09:32.576
and handover.

178
09:32.656 --> 09:33.536
I need a heads-up

179
09:33.816 --> 09:34.377
to be ready.

180
09:35.097 --> 09:36.296
Make sure to hide it well.

181
09:36.416 --> 09:37.137
Don't get caught.

182
09:45.617 --> 09:46.776
Here, have some grapes.

183
09:46.857 --> 09:48.056
Good for hangovers and nausea.

184
09:48.656 --> 09:50.137
Love you, Zi.

185
09:51.337 --> 09:52.457
My head hurts so much.

186
10:03.056 --> 10:03.617
(My team)

187
10:03.737 --> 10:04.857
(needs someone for PR.)

188
10:05.497 --> 10:06.536
(I think you're the one.)

189
10:06.977 --> 10:07.337
(Got)

190
10:07.377 --> 10:08.457
(any interest?)

191
10:10.617 --> 10:12.176
Kang Long caught on pretty fast.

192
10:13.457 --> 10:13.977
That's great.

193
10:14.137 --> 10:14.776
Now you don't

194
10:14.776 --> 10:15.696
have to stress over

195
10:15.776 --> 10:16.862
joining Zhang Yu's team.

196
10:17.576 --> 10:18.416
Exactly.

197
10:19.296 --> 10:20.137
Kang Long's lab

198
10:20.137 --> 10:21.857
is developing a brand-new product line,

199
10:22.536 --> 10:23.977
sharing all channels and data

200
10:23.977 --> 10:25.296
from the Jinghua line.

201
10:25.656 --> 10:26.857
That way,

202
10:26.857 --> 10:28.936
I can naturally access information

203
10:29.056 --> 10:30.017
on all the partners,

204
10:30.296 --> 10:32.017
including procurement

205
10:32.257 --> 10:33.576
and OEM factories.

206
10:34.097 --> 10:34.776
Congratulations.

207
10:34.936 --> 10:35.936
Things are looking up.

208
10:36.377 --> 10:37.337
Not yet.

209
10:38.137 --> 10:38.896
I have to handle

210
10:38.896 --> 10:40.536
the lab's publicity

211
10:40.536 --> 10:42.457
to boost its commercial value

212
10:42.576 --> 10:43.416
and influence.

213
10:43.977 --> 10:44.776
Here's what I think.

214
10:45.137 --> 10:46.576
I want to interview him first,

215
10:46.816 --> 10:47.296
and post

216
10:47.296 --> 10:48.257
the video content

217
10:48.296 --> 10:49.176
on my account

218
10:49.176 --> 10:50.410
so everyone can see it.

219
10:50.977 --> 10:51.536
Sounds good.

220
10:52.416 --> 10:53.696
Send him a few locations first.

221
11:00.617 --> 11:01.296
Actually, we go

222
11:01.296 --> 11:02.617
way back.

223
11:04.696 --> 11:05.587
What do you mean?

224
11:06.257 --> 11:07.337
You go way back?

225
11:15.176 --> 11:16.536
The man who gave me this

226
11:16.656 --> 11:17.176
was him.

227
11:20.457 --> 11:21.137
Mom.

228
11:22.656 --> 11:24.497
That hedgehog isn't her dad, is it?

229
11:25.536 --> 11:26.296
It really is him?

230
11:26.776 --> 11:27.497
Mom,

231
11:27.776 --> 11:28.457
Ms. Meng,

232
11:29.217 --> 11:30.497
are you having

233
11:30.656 --> 11:32.176
a secret adult conversation

234
11:32.377 --> 11:33.536
that I shouldn't hear?

235
11:33.737 --> 11:34.816
Not at all.

236
11:35.017 --> 11:36.056
We're talking about work.

237
11:36.257 --> 11:37.097
Be good, Chestnut.

238
11:37.217 --> 11:37.977
Go wash up

239
11:38.137 --> 11:38.977
and eat breakfast.

240
11:38.977 --> 11:39.457
Okay.

241
11:39.576 --> 11:40.137
Go on.

242
11:43.857 --> 11:44.896
Oh, my!

243
11:45.776 --> 11:47.137
What a coincidence!

244
11:47.696 --> 11:48.576
Are you...

245
11:48.857 --> 11:49.737
Are you sure

246
11:49.857 --> 11:50.977
it's the same person?

247
11:51.416 --> 11:52.217
Yes.

248
11:52.896 --> 11:53.936
Kang Long is the father,

249
11:53.936 --> 11:55.257
the one I've been

250
11:55.377 --> 11:56.536
searching for for months.

251
12:02.536 --> 12:03.776
That hurts! What are you doing?

252
12:04.257 --> 12:05.296
It really isn't a dream.

253
12:06.497 --> 12:08.217
I actually wish it were a dream.

254
12:09.337 --> 12:10.097
What about him?

255
12:10.656 --> 12:11.497
Did he recognize you?

256
12:11.857 --> 12:12.656
He did,

257
12:13.257 --> 12:14.696
but I pretended not to know him.

258
12:15.617 --> 12:16.217
After all,

259
12:16.217 --> 12:17.296
we'll be working together.

260
12:17.656 --> 12:18.977
I don't want to complicate things

261
12:19.137 --> 12:19.816
and affect work.

262
12:21.497 --> 12:22.056
No way.

263
12:22.576 --> 12:23.576
You'll definitely

264
12:23.737 --> 12:25.416
feel uncomfortable and awkward.

265
12:26.257 --> 12:27.097
How about this?

266
12:27.097 --> 12:28.457
I'll switch to someone else.

267
12:28.457 --> 12:29.056
No need.

268
12:29.419 --> 12:30.896
Work and personal life are different.

269
12:30.896 --> 12:31.737
I keep things clear.

270
12:33.137 --> 12:33.776
I didn't

271
12:33.857 --> 12:34.857
tell you right away

272
12:35.017 --> 12:36.377
because your partnership with him

273
12:36.377 --> 12:37.176
wasn't finalized.

274
12:37.457 --> 12:38.896
I didn't want to influence you.

275
12:39.337 --> 12:40.137
Now, the partnership

276
12:40.137 --> 12:41.176
is settled.

277
12:41.337 --> 12:42.217
I had to be honest

278
12:42.217 --> 12:43.176
with you beforehand,

279
12:43.536 --> 12:44.296
so it won't cause

280
12:44.337 --> 12:45.416
any misunderstandings later

281
12:45.617 --> 12:46.536
and affect your work.

282
12:47.017 --> 12:48.857
You're the best.

283
12:51.257 --> 12:52.337
But your plate

284
12:52.337 --> 12:53.656
is way too full.

285
12:54.576 --> 12:55.576
Didn't you say last time

286
12:55.896 --> 12:56.816
you need an assistant?

287
12:57.296 --> 12:58.257
Well? Found anyone?

288
12:58.377 --> 12:59.377
No one suitable yet.

289
12:59.536 --> 13:00.416
I'll keep looking.

290
13:01.857 --> 13:02.257
Alright.

291
13:02.617 --> 13:03.377
Keep looking then.

292
13:03.896 --> 13:04.857
I'll go find Dr. Kang

293
13:04.977 --> 13:06.056
to coordinate with him.

294
13:06.497 --> 13:07.217
It's about time

295
13:07.337 --> 13:08.258
to take her to school.

296
13:09.257 --> 13:09.816
I'm off.

297
13:10.536 --> 13:11.097
Wait.

298
13:11.936 --> 13:12.776
Aren't you curious

299
13:12.776 --> 13:13.576
about what I'll do

300
13:13.696 --> 13:14.977
about Kang Long and Chestnut?

301
13:15.377 --> 13:15.936
You'd never

302
13:15.977 --> 13:17.176
hurt Chestnut.

303
13:17.497 --> 13:18.857
So whatever you decide,

304
13:19.097 --> 13:20.137
I'll support you.

305
13:21.329 --> 13:24.375
(Rooftop Tile Cafe)

306
13:33.536 --> 13:34.337
Almost here.

307
13:35.810 --> 13:38.296
(Zi)

308
13:38.296 --> 13:39.017
It's her.

309
13:39.416 --> 13:40.217
Almost here.

310
13:40.737 --> 13:41.337
Almost.

311
13:44.936 --> 13:45.497
Hello, Zi?

312
13:47.457 --> 13:47.977
Buddy,

313
13:48.137 --> 13:49.137
thanks to you,

314
13:49.416 --> 13:49.896
or I'd be

315
13:49.936 --> 13:50.857
at my wit's end.

316
13:54.416 --> 13:55.257
I have to go now.

317
13:55.696 --> 13:56.176
See you.

318
13:56.776 --> 13:57.696
My shoot over here

319
13:57.696 --> 13:58.337
isn't over yet.

320
13:58.497 --> 13:59.337
I really can't leave.

321
13:59.737 --> 14:00.306
Don't worry.

322
14:00.337 --> 14:01.497
I've sent someone over.

323
14:01.696 --> 14:02.896
He'll arrive in half an hour.

324
14:03.656 --> 14:05.137
That's too late!

325
14:05.217 --> 14:05.977
He just said

326
14:05.977 --> 14:06.896
he'll leave if we don't

327
14:06.896 --> 14:07.536
start in ten.

328
14:07.857 --> 14:08.296
Or check

329
14:08.337 --> 14:09.416
if there's someone suitable

330
14:09.536 --> 14:10.416
and send them over?

331
14:10.617 --> 14:11.696
Pay is totally negotiable.

332
14:13.017 --> 14:13.896
Hurry up!

333
14:20.696 --> 14:21.296
We meet again.

334
14:22.536 --> 14:23.217
Ha...

335
14:23.576 --> 14:24.176
Harry.

336
14:24.257 --> 14:24.737
Harry.

337
14:25.296 --> 14:25.857
Hello.

338
14:26.097 --> 14:27.097
I happened to overhear

339
14:27.137 --> 14:27.857
your phone call.

340
14:27.857 --> 14:28.816
You're in a pinch.

341
14:29.337 --> 14:30.176
If you don't mind,

342
14:30.457 --> 14:31.176
I could try.

343
14:31.416 --> 14:32.229
What do you mean?

344
14:32.536 --> 14:33.176
Are you saying

345
14:33.629 --> 14:34.497
you know how to shoot?

346
14:34.497 --> 14:35.097
Of course.

347
14:35.257 --> 14:36.416
All the galas at my school

348
14:36.576 --> 14:37.337
were shot by me.

349
14:37.497 --> 14:38.137
Great.

350
14:38.377 --> 14:38.776
Let's go.

351
14:39.536 --> 14:40.936
That wraps up today's interview.

352
14:41.137 --> 14:42.377
Let's thank Dr. Kang

353
14:42.536 --> 14:43.776
for sharing valuable insights.

354
14:44.217 --> 14:45.217
Okay, cut.

355
14:46.137 --> 14:46.732
Let me see.

356
14:47.017 --> 14:47.457
Well...

357
14:48.176 --> 14:48.776
Is Liu Zi

358
14:48.896 --> 14:49.737
still involved?

359
14:50.776 --> 14:52.056
Liu Zi?

360
14:52.457 --> 14:54.056
It's not certain yet.

361
14:54.137 --> 14:54.617
Why?

362
14:54.896 --> 14:55.827
Care about her so much?

363
14:56.656 --> 14:57.634
She looks familiar,

364
14:57.936 --> 14:58.896
a bit like a friend.

365
14:59.816 --> 15:00.457
Dr. Kang,

366
15:01.017 --> 15:02.257
that pickup line

367
15:02.257 --> 15:03.457
is a bit outdated nowadays.

368
15:04.497 --> 15:06.257
Though someone as accomplished as you

369
15:06.696 --> 15:07.696
must be very popular.

370
15:08.176 --> 15:08.896
I... I'm single.

371
15:11.536 --> 15:11.896
Okay.

372
15:12.257 --> 15:12.977
Great work today.

373
15:13.312 --> 15:14.457
Hope to work with you again.

374
15:14.457 --> 15:14.776
Okay.

375
15:19.457 --> 15:19.977
Thank you.

376
15:20.137 --> 15:20.497
Thanks.

377
15:20.497 --> 15:21.097
Thank you.

378
15:22.217 --> 15:23.536
How was it? Are you done?

379
15:24.576 --> 15:25.261
Just wrapped.

380
15:25.377 --> 15:26.257
Just being polite.

381
15:26.857 --> 15:28.217
Who asked about that?

382
15:29.257 --> 15:30.137
Are you off work now?

383
15:30.217 --> 15:30.977
Shall we...

384
15:31.217 --> 15:32.217
The footage? Let me see.

385
15:32.617 --> 15:33.097
Right here.

386
15:34.617 --> 15:35.296
And you are...

387
15:36.896 --> 15:37.296
Hello.

388
15:37.617 --> 15:39.257
I'm Meng's new assistant.

389
15:42.576 --> 15:43.017
Hello.

390
15:43.337 --> 15:43.857
Just kidding.

391
15:44.217 --> 15:44.936
I saw you were

392
15:45.017 --> 15:45.617
short-handed.

393
15:45.737 --> 15:46.217
Why not

394
15:46.576 --> 15:47.296
hire me part-time?

395
15:49.617 --> 15:50.176
You don't

396
15:50.217 --> 15:51.776
look like someone who's short on cash.

397
15:52.137 --> 15:53.217
School let out early.

398
15:53.416 --> 15:54.696
I snuck back into the country.

399
15:54.816 --> 15:56.217
If I withdraw cash or use cards,

400
15:56.737 --> 15:57.617
my parents will know.

401
15:57.776 --> 15:58.257
Not bad.

402
15:58.457 --> 15:59.097
Good shots.

403
15:59.696 --> 16:00.377
It's pretty good.

404
16:04.296 --> 16:05.656
I really think he's great.

405
16:06.176 --> 16:06.896
Why don't we

406
16:08.056 --> 16:08.696
keep him?

407
16:08.857 --> 16:09.617
Sure.

408
16:09.816 --> 16:10.857
As long as you're happy.

409
16:11.337 --> 16:12.936
I'll keep recruiting.

410
16:13.056 --> 16:14.337
When he goes back to school,

411
16:14.377 --> 16:15.257
we'll have a backup.

412
16:16.137 --> 16:16.857
The problem is,

413
16:16.896 --> 16:18.377
are you having him split his time

414
16:18.497 --> 16:20.017
between Rongmei and Jiali?

415
16:21.457 --> 16:22.296
Just Rongmei for now.

416
16:22.896 --> 16:24.497
We should keep a low profile at Jiali.

417
16:24.857 --> 16:25.457
And it's easier

418
16:25.457 --> 16:26.536
for me to move on my own.

419
16:28.257 --> 16:29.656
Alright, I'll go tell him.

420
16:32.056 --> 16:33.137
Then later, will you...

421
16:35.536 --> 16:36.097
Dr. Kang.

422
16:36.977 --> 16:37.536
Dr. Kang,

423
16:38.056 --> 16:39.576
you just mentioned in the interview

424
16:39.696 --> 16:40.977
you've reviewed

425
16:40.977 --> 16:42.056
all Jiali's project files.

426
16:42.257 --> 16:43.617
If I may ask,

427
16:43.857 --> 16:45.176
how are the OEMs

428
16:45.176 --> 16:46.217
Jiali works with

429
16:46.416 --> 16:47.137
this time?

430
16:47.576 --> 16:48.137
Not good.

431
16:48.656 --> 16:49.857
Once my new product's out,

432
16:49.977 --> 16:50.737
I won't be working

433
16:50.776 --> 16:51.217
with them.

434
16:51.617 --> 16:52.416
Not good?

435
16:53.457 --> 16:55.097
What kind of issues are there?

436
16:56.416 --> 16:57.656
Their quality standards

437
16:57.816 --> 16:58.377
are quite low.

438
16:59.217 --> 17:00.037
Especially this one.

439
17:00.896 --> 17:02.576
It was established only eight months ago,

440
17:02.576 --> 17:03.776
and has no OEM experience

441
17:03.936 --> 17:04.816
with other companies.

442
17:05.056 --> 17:05.616
But they can

443
17:05.616 --> 17:06.457
take Jinghua OEM work

444
17:06.536 --> 17:07.136
right away.

445
17:07.417 --> 17:08.576
The quality risk is enormous.

446
17:09.592 --> 17:11.398
(Guangsili'er Biotech Co., Ltd.)

447
17:11.398 --> 17:13.055
(Shareholder &amp; Executive: Han Guang)

448
17:15.296 --> 17:16.417
Han Guang...

449
17:18.210 --> 17:20.284
(Mom)

450
17:20.856 --> 17:21.336
Hello, Mom.

451
17:24.576 --> 17:25.136
Okay.

452
17:26.937 --> 17:28.536
So this was your urgent matter?

453
17:29.376 --> 17:30.136
I almost put work

454
17:30.136 --> 17:30.937
on hold for this.

455
17:32.257 --> 17:33.257
If I hadn't said that,

456
17:33.536 --> 17:34.776
would you come for the checkup?

457
17:35.937 --> 17:36.856
Now that you're here,

458
17:36.937 --> 17:38.217
I'm not letting you leave.

459
17:38.376 --> 17:39.177
Anyway,

460
17:39.177 --> 17:40.616
finish the check before going back.

461
17:43.136 --> 17:43.977
Wait, Mom.

462
17:45.017 --> 17:46.336
How did you know I'm pregnant?

463
17:47.296 --> 17:48.257
Di Liren told you that?

464
17:54.017 --> 17:55.816
Or did Ms. Hui?

465
17:56.136 --> 17:56.697
Well,

466
17:57.417 --> 17:59.056
Liren had her bring some soup over.

467
17:59.177 --> 18:00.697
I asked

468
18:00.937 --> 18:02.497
how you two were doing,

469
18:02.737 --> 18:03.376
and found out.

470
18:03.697 --> 18:04.576
Alright.

471
18:04.897 --> 18:05.937
Hurry up and get checked.

472
18:06.497 --> 18:07.457
Once you're done,

473
18:07.497 --> 18:08.299
your father and I...

474
18:08.697 --> 18:10.017
I'm not going, Mom.

475
18:11.096 --> 18:12.296
To be honest with you,

476
18:12.497 --> 18:13.776
my period just started today.

477
18:14.096 --> 18:15.296
I'm not pregnant at all.

478
18:16.697 --> 18:17.417
Really?

479
18:17.897 --> 18:18.897
Why would I lie to you?

480
18:19.737 --> 18:20.856
I'm upset about it, too.

481
18:24.136 --> 18:25.536
Don't worry, Mom.

482
18:26.497 --> 18:27.177
Ms. Hui has been

483
18:27.336 --> 18:28.616
taking great care of me lately.

484
18:29.017 --> 18:30.776
I'll definitely focus on trying to conceive,

485
18:31.417 --> 18:32.937
and give you healthy grandsons

486
18:33.257 --> 18:34.217
and granddaughters,

487
18:34.697 --> 18:35.697
lots of grandbabies

488
18:35.737 --> 18:36.536
for you to hold.

489
18:36.737 --> 18:37.336
Alright then.

490
18:39.937 --> 18:40.576
The pregnancy

491
18:40.576 --> 18:41.816
was cleared up just like that?

492
18:42.177 --> 18:43.257
Since she sent my mom

493
18:43.336 --> 18:44.417
to test me,

494
18:44.697 --> 18:45.897
I gave her what she wanted.

495
18:47.177 --> 18:48.017
Besides,

496
18:48.697 --> 18:50.296
I didn't want to keep using this

497
18:50.856 --> 18:52.096
to deceive my parents.

498
18:53.056 --> 18:53.897
I understand.

499
18:54.096 --> 18:56.017
I'm just worried that once it's cleared up,

500
18:56.257 --> 18:57.897
Lu Hui might run off without any worries.

501
19:01.257 --> 19:02.096
Think about it.

502
19:02.937 --> 19:04.816
She's desperate for an answer,

503
19:04.937 --> 19:06.536
which means she cares deeply.

504
19:06.897 --> 19:07.737
And such obsession

505
19:07.856 --> 19:08.816
won't just disappear

506
19:08.816 --> 19:10.056
whether there's a child or not.

507
19:10.417 --> 19:11.217
So she won't leave.

508
19:11.697 --> 19:12.536
At least,

509
19:12.897 --> 19:14.177
not until her mind is at ease.

510
19:14.576 --> 19:15.017
Sis...

511
19:15.017 --> 19:15.816
Don't touch me!

512
19:15.937 --> 19:16.737
Don't touch me!

513
19:16.977 --> 19:17.897
Don't touch me!

514
19:18.096 --> 19:18.536
Sis?

515
19:18.897 --> 19:20.376
I... I have to go.

516
19:23.897 --> 19:24.457
Watch out!

517
19:26.136 --> 19:27.376
Watch out!

518
19:27.457 --> 19:28.017
Who are you?

519
19:28.217 --> 19:28.897
Don't touch me!

520
19:29.177 --> 19:29.816
Don't touch me!

521
19:30.657 --> 19:31.417
Help me!

522
19:31.816 --> 19:32.497
Please!

523
19:39.177 --> 19:39.616
Let me go!

524
19:41.576 --> 19:42.376
That scared me.

525
19:43.536 --> 19:44.017
Seriously.

526
19:45.217 --> 19:45.977
Family member.

527
19:47.136 --> 19:47.616
Ma'am,

528
19:48.096 --> 19:49.056
go in with my sister.

529
19:50.457 --> 19:50.816
Alright.

530
19:56.937 --> 19:58.017
Please disperse, everyone.

531
19:58.017 --> 19:58.657
Stop watching.

532
19:59.296 --> 19:59.697
It's okay.

533
19:59.816 --> 20:00.376
Save me!

534
20:00.376 --> 20:01.217
It's okay.

535
20:01.217 --> 20:01.977
Help me...

536
20:02.177 --> 20:02.657
It's okay.

537
20:09.497 --> 20:10.536
Move along, everyone.

538
20:10.536 --> 20:11.657
Don't crowd around.

539
20:12.536 --> 20:13.217
Move along.

540
20:32.355 --> 20:35.769
(Mental Health Center VCT Clinic)

541
20:35.776 --> 20:36.376
This

542
20:36.776 --> 20:37.816
must be what she dropped

543
20:38.096 --> 20:39.017
just now.

544
20:42.217 --> 20:42.977
Thank you.

545
20:44.737 --> 20:46.697
She's my sister,

546
20:47.776 --> 20:48.376
Weng Xin.

547
20:52.017 --> 20:53.296
She really loves this bag charm.

548
20:56.257 --> 20:58.376
People said your sister stays home all year round

549
20:58.576 --> 20:59.854
and doesn't like socializing.

550
21:00.657 --> 21:01.576
So that's why.

551
21:02.737 --> 21:03.856
Please keep

552
21:04.177 --> 21:05.376
today's matter between us.

553
21:05.776 --> 21:06.977
Actually, my family

554
21:07.136 --> 21:08.417
has been heartbroken

555
21:08.536 --> 21:09.576
over her sudden illness.

556
21:09.897 --> 21:10.657
Normally,

557
21:10.856 --> 21:11.977
they don't let her go out.

558
21:13.457 --> 21:14.336
They only let me

559
21:14.497 --> 21:15.856
take her out

560
21:16.296 --> 21:17.376
for monthly check-ups.

561
21:19.376 --> 21:20.497
How long has your sister

562
21:20.937 --> 21:21.616
been like this?

563
21:22.497 --> 21:24.856
About three years.

564
21:25.576 --> 21:26.616
Three years...

565
21:26.937 --> 21:27.909
What about Han Guang?

566
21:28.177 --> 21:28.897
Why isn't he here?

567
21:31.376 --> 21:32.017
Mr. Han

568
21:32.897 --> 21:34.497
is busy running our family business.

569
21:35.576 --> 21:36.697
It must be tough on you,

570
21:37.856 --> 21:38.897
taking care of your sister

571
21:39.536 --> 21:40.816
while fighting for the company.

572
21:43.657 --> 21:44.336
My parents

573
21:44.457 --> 21:45.457
have stepped down anyway.

574
21:46.096 --> 21:46.937
I'm the only Weng

575
21:47.177 --> 21:48.657
still at the company.

576
21:49.257 --> 21:50.096
I have to hold on.

577
21:50.536 --> 21:52.576
No wonder you stayed till the end

578
21:53.257 --> 21:54.417
of Mr. Wu's dinner last time,

579
21:54.977 --> 21:56.096
despite not wanting to.

580
21:56.257 --> 21:57.017
I had no choice.

581
21:57.737 --> 21:59.096
Once a woman sits at the table,

582
21:59.376 --> 22:00.257
she has no choice

583
22:01.536 --> 22:02.457
but stay in the game.

584
22:05.177 --> 22:06.257
Meeting Miss Weng

585
22:06.257 --> 22:07.296
is such a pleasure!

586
22:07.296 --> 22:08.361
Come on, Miss Weng,

587
22:10.177 --> 22:10.897
a toast to you.

588
22:11.657 --> 22:12.177
Bottoms up.

589
22:20.177 --> 22:20.816
Miss Weng,

590
22:21.816 --> 22:22.536
let me tell you.

591
22:23.017 --> 22:23.576
I have another

592
22:23.616 --> 22:24.776
impressive talent.

593
22:25.737 --> 22:26.977
I read fortunes.

594
22:28.096 --> 22:29.136
Come, let me read yours.

595
22:30.336 --> 22:33.257
Your lifeline is quite long,

596
22:33.776 --> 22:35.737
but not very deep.

597
22:36.776 --> 22:37.457
Hold on.

598
22:37.576 --> 22:38.056
Wait.

599
22:38.257 --> 22:40.056
Let me check your heart line.

600
22:40.576 --> 22:41.909
Left for men, right for women.

601
22:42.217 --> 22:43.096
Let me see this side.

602
22:43.096 --> 22:43.776
Mr. Zhou,

603
22:44.576 --> 22:45.497
let me propose a toast.

604
22:45.657 --> 22:46.856
Sure, just a moment.

605
22:47.177 --> 22:48.056
Let me see.

606
22:48.657 --> 22:49.217
By the way,

607
22:49.296 --> 22:50.816
please give my regards to your wife.

608
22:50.937 --> 22:52.336
I bumped into her a few days ago.

609
22:57.296 --> 22:58.177
What a coincidence!

610
22:58.697 --> 22:59.657
Where did you see her?

611
23:01.576 --> 23:02.056
Weng Yue,

612
23:02.336 --> 23:03.457
swap seats with me.

613
23:03.897 --> 23:04.576
It's drafty here.

614
23:04.576 --> 23:05.582
You're underdressed.

615
23:06.897 --> 23:07.376
Okay.

616
23:11.177 --> 23:11.937
Family of Weng Xin.

617
23:11.937 --> 23:12.376
Here.

618
23:15.417 --> 23:16.257
I'm going in now.

619
23:17.217 --> 23:18.816
Mr. Yu is in such good shape.

620
23:18.977 --> 23:19.816
I'm sure he'll

621
23:19.856 --> 23:20.616
get through this.

622
23:21.616 --> 23:22.217
Thank you.

623
23:31.376 --> 23:31.776
Dad,

624
23:32.497 --> 23:33.937
Duan told me

625
23:34.336 --> 23:35.616
you've had headaches lately

626
23:35.616 --> 23:36.629
and couldn't sleep.

627
23:36.697 --> 23:37.616
What's going on?

628
23:39.257 --> 23:41.576
My head's been splitting lately.

629
23:42.096 --> 23:43.616
Whenever I close my eyes,

630
23:44.776 --> 23:46.856
I keep hearing these noises

631
23:47.096 --> 23:48.737
right by my ear.

632
23:48.856 --> 23:50.136
It's so loud.

633
23:51.457 --> 23:52.497
Loud?

634
23:57.417 --> 23:57.937
Come on, Dad.

635
23:59.737 --> 24:00.336
Sit up.

636
24:00.816 --> 24:01.177
Come on.

637
24:01.336 --> 24:01.697
Come on.

638
24:01.856 --> 24:02.576
Turn around.

639
24:02.697 --> 24:03.765
I'll massage your head.

640
24:04.417 --> 24:04.776
Come on.

641
24:10.937 --> 24:11.417
How is it?

642
24:11.816 --> 24:12.417
Feel good?

643
24:12.457 --> 24:12.937
Gotta say,

644
24:12.937 --> 24:15.017
it actually helps a lot.

645
24:16.056 --> 24:16.737
Sweetheart,

646
24:17.177 --> 24:18.417
when did you learn

647
24:18.457 --> 24:19.657
how to massage?

648
24:19.937 --> 24:20.417
I learned it

649
24:20.457 --> 24:21.697
online over the past few days.

650
24:22.017 --> 24:23.296
The tutorials are very detailed.

651
24:23.417 --> 24:24.737
My daughter is so clever.

652
24:24.856 --> 24:25.937
Always been this way,

653
24:26.136 --> 24:27.897
you pick up everything so quickly.

654
24:28.056 --> 24:29.257
I get it from you.

655
24:29.616 --> 24:31.856
Look at you, always knowing the right thing to say.

656
24:33.697 --> 24:34.017
Dad,

657
24:35.096 --> 24:36.376
if you really can't sleep,

658
24:37.177 --> 24:38.257
I'll get you another room.

659
24:38.536 --> 24:39.417
No need.

660
24:41.217 --> 24:42.737
Maybe it's just my old age

661
24:42.977 --> 24:45.376
making me hear things.

662
24:45.616 --> 24:47.376
Why isn't the calming medication

663
24:47.576 --> 24:48.657
the doctor prescribed

664
24:48.697 --> 24:50.776
working at all?

665
24:57.657 --> 24:58.536
Much better.

666
25:00.977 --> 25:03.056
There's no noise outside the window.

667
25:12.497 --> 25:13.816
And nothing wrong with the room.

668
25:15.136 --> 25:16.376
How about this, Dad?

669
25:16.536 --> 25:17.177
I'll ask

670
25:17.177 --> 25:18.481
the doctor about your situation.

671
25:18.616 --> 25:19.897
Go check your hallucinations.

672
25:20.257 --> 25:20.816
Meng,

673
25:21.977 --> 25:23.737
have you been to the company lately?

674
25:23.937 --> 25:25.177
How are things there?

675
25:26.217 --> 25:27.376
They're great.

676
25:27.897 --> 25:29.217
Let me give you a quick update

677
25:29.296 --> 25:30.937
on how work's been going.

678
25:35.616 --> 25:36.177
Ms. Hui.

679
25:37.897 --> 25:38.776
Did you wash

680
25:38.816 --> 25:39.417
all the sheets

681
25:39.417 --> 25:40.113
and duvet covers?

682
25:40.937 --> 25:41.737
You're home, Honey.

683
25:43.257 --> 25:43.816
Honey.

684
25:47.257 --> 25:49.376
That's a lot of work. You must be tired.

685
25:49.977 --> 25:51.336
Why wash it all in one day?

686
25:52.336 --> 25:53.457
It's been so dusty lately.

687
25:53.697 --> 25:54.616
It's sunny,

688
25:54.897 --> 25:55.856
so I washed and changed

689
25:55.897 --> 25:56.937
all of them.

690
26:20.009 --> 26:20.917
(Ultra thin, 10 condoms)

691
26:24.217 --> 26:24.657
They...

692
26:30.417 --> 26:31.457
Disgusting.

693
26:37.776 --> 26:38.376
Careful.

694
26:38.616 --> 26:39.536
Hurry up a bit.

695
26:39.737 --> 26:40.536
Get all this junk

696
26:40.536 --> 26:41.096
out of here.

697
26:47.177 --> 26:47.776
Honey,

698
26:48.217 --> 26:49.096
what's going on?

699
26:49.417 --> 26:50.217
Are we moving?

700
26:50.977 --> 26:51.737
No.

701
26:52.217 --> 26:53.296
I bought a new bed

702
26:53.417 --> 26:54.776
to replace the old one.

703
26:56.217 --> 26:56.616
Careful.

